OL,3,GNEWSAFour cancers in 40 years: 'I'm
OL,4,Alucky to be alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cough began in 2020 and would not
OL,7,Fgo away. Susan Gasson thought it was
OL,8,Fjust a tickle in her throat and did not
OL,9,Fsuspect her lungs.
OL,11,FAn X-ray found a mass, and she was
OL,12,Flater told she had lung cancer, her
OL,13,Ffourth cancer diagnosis in four
OL,14,Fdecades.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
