OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFour cancers in 40 years: 'I'm
OL,4,Alucky to be alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 75-year-old from Greenwich in
OL,7,Fsouth-east London, had already been
OL,8,Ftreated for breast, cervical and
OL,9,Fthyroid cancer. When the lung cancer
OL,10,Freturned after surgery, chemotherapy
OL,11,Fand radiotherapy, she joined a clinical
OL,12,Ftrial and now takes a single tablet a
OL,13,Fday.
OL,15,F"I feel lucky to still be here," she
OL,16,Fsaid. "I get to watch my grandchildren
OL,17,Fgrow up."
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
